{title: My Shepherd Is the Lord}
{subtitle: Psalm 23}
{key: C}
{tempo: 85}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [C] | ×11

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
The Lord is my shepherd
My shepherd, I shall [Am]not want
He makes me lie [G]down in green [F]pastures
He leads me [C]beside still waters
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
My shepherd is the Lord, the Lord
My shepherd is the Lord
[Am]My shepherd is the Lord, [G]the Lord
[F]My shepherd [G]is the [C]Lord
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
He restores my [Am]soul
He [F]leads me in paths of [C]righteousness
[Am]Even in the valley of the [G]shadow of death
[F]I will fear no evil, [C]for you are with me
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
My shepherd is the Lord, the Lord
My shepherd is the Lord
My [Am]shepherd is the Lord, the [G]Lord
My [F]shepherd [G]is the [C]Lord
{end_of_chorus}
